Dungeon Cooking hit me after I read The CRPG Book (Bitmap Books). After that book I started playing older games, and it was really through Beneath Apple Manor and Dungeon Campaign that I started thinking about making my own. That’s how Dungeon Cooking ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T15:26:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4756260-1840310314347793","game_id":"steam-4756260","kind":"announcement","title":"A game that isn't afraid to let you down","summary":"Dungeon Cooking comes out on November 19. Before it does, I want to say plainly what kind of game this is and how it was made.Why I'm making itNot to make money. I'm making a game that wouldn't have been afraid to come out in the eighties or nineties.Games like that barely come out anymore. I say \"barely\" on purpose, because the exceptions exist and I know them well. Someone is going to name a few titles in the comments and they will be right. I play those games myself. But they are still except","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T16:09:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4756260-1836506165571511","game_id":"steam-4756260","kind":"announcement","title":"The Assistant's Log, Day 7","summary":"Day 7They came back with ingredients we hadn't seen before. Had to test them before any of it went in the pot.Before I got started, I had a word with the Alchemist.The choices were rats, someone from the team, or a citizen willing to step up.Funny thing, there's no currency left in the city anymore. Everything runs on trade now. When food gets scarce, food becomes the currency.Started with the rats.Three ingredients in, three dead rats.Then came the worse choice. A citizen, or someone from the t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T21:28:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165571511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4756260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4756260":"2026-10-26T14:06:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4756260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:49Z"},"5090480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:50Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4756260","app_id":4756260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"4104ff7e1b77d6afa6c858a5c7dc556c6072573f2191794ee044b9c516961379","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A dark cooking roguelike about feeding a plague-struck town. Send heroes into the dungeon for ingredients and cook what they bring back. Test the ingredients on rats, heroes, or citizens. And keep the kitchen alive as the town slowly falls apart.","publishers":[{"name":"Unkind Logic"}],"developers":[{"name":"Unkind Logic"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795082340,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display"